mod.desc:
SRO Catenary+ (Full) v0.3 is a mod that:
- Adds a catenary to every railway of the map: Sawyer, Meier, Spycakes and Camodo, the Arctic and the sea lines between the islands (except the line to the ship launching dock and the spaceport launch pad in Meier);
- The catenary, when created, was almost entirely based on the state standards of Russia and the USSR for AC (25 kV) catenary;
- The catenary is divided into sections of ~1.6 km, where each section begins and ends on a semi-compensated anchor cable, as well as dead ends and ends of the catenary;
- The catenary has a 300 mm zigzag for more uniform wear of the pantographs, and also has a wind-resistant suspension of the catenary itself (the carrier cable runs out of phase with the contact wire);
- On the sea viaducts the poles stand on brackets, in the tunnel to Spycakes the catenary hangs from the vault;
- Includes the whole Stormworks Railway Overhaul (SRO): use it instead of SRO, SRO Catenary+ (Sawyer) or SRO Catenary+ (Meier), not together with them;
- Supports and crossbars of wide spans have a collision! Keep this in mind, and do not fly into them with a car: the support will hold, but the car will not :)
